<view class="trade">
  <view wx:if="{{busy && !detail && !message}}" class="mj-read-state"><mj-loading label="正在读取优惠券详情"/></view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="feedback">{{message}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><block wx:if="{{detail}}"><view class="section hero"><view class="row"><text class="heading">{{detail.name}}</text><text class="badge">{{detail.label}}</text></view><view class="amount">{{detail.value}}</view><view>租金满 ¥{{detail.threshold}} 可用</view></view><view class="section"><view class="row"><text>有效期</text><view>{{detail.validFromText}}<view></view>至 {{detail.validUntilText}}</view></view><view class="row"><text>适用范围</text><text>{{detail.scopeType==='all'?'平台全部工厂':'指定工厂（结算时核对适用范围）'}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>不可抵扣</text><text>押金、运费、补款</text></view><view class="row"><text>每次使用</text><text>最多一张</text></view><view wx:if="{{detail.returnedAtText}}" class="muted">返还于 {{detail.returnedAtText}}，已保留较长的原有效期或至少顺延七天。</view></view><view class="notice">优惠仅减适用租金，比例按分向下取整。每家工厂现金支付至少 ¥0.01，实际优惠可能小于券面额，提交前会展示。</view><view class="footer"><button class="primary" bindtap="use">去选道具</button></view></block></view>